// A function whose cases leave a gap, for tests/run.sh's `mutscore` section:
// 10 is above the line and 3 below it, but nothing pins where the line is, so
// moving it from > 9 to >= 9 goes unnoticed. The other three mutants (the line
// moved to 10, the result forced to 0, the result forced to 1) each fail a
// case. Four mutants, three killed, one survived: a score of 75.0.
big(int n) {
  int r = n > 9;
} return int r;
(10):(1)
(3):(0)
